// Ficha Dev on the iPhone signs automatically with Lucas's free Personal Team
// (#97). The team's ID stays out of the repo, in Local.xcconfig next to this
// file, which git ignores: a line like `DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345`, as
// docs/development.md explains. Without it, the app still builds for the
// simulator, as CI builds it, but not for an iPhone.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
